# Platform-specific chdman binaries

This directory contains platform-specific chdman binaries bundled with the application.

## Directory Structure

```
binaries/
├── windows/    # chdman.exe for Windows
├── linux/      # chdman for Linux
└── macos/      # chdman for macOS
```

## Bundled Binaries

The correct binary is selected automatically based on the host OS detection.

### Sources

- Windows: MAME tools (chdman.exe)
- macOS: MAME tools (chdman)
- Linux: MAME tools (chdman)

### Notes

- All binaries should be verified against official MAME releases
- Binaries are loaded from this directory at runtime
- The application will fall back to system PATH if bundled binaries are not found
